node958 [ shape=none, color=black label=< <table color='#666666' cellborder='0' cellspacing='0' border='1'><tr><td colspan='2' bgcolor='grey'><B>analyzed</B></td></tr><tr><td href='https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/SbomType/analyzed' bgcolor='#eeeeee' colspan='2'><font point-size='10' color='#6666ff'>https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/SbomType/analyzed</font></td></tr><tr><td align='left'>rdfs:comment</td><td align='left'>&quot;SBOM generated through analysis of artifacts (e.g., executables, packages, containers, and virtual machine images) after its build. Such analysis generally requires a variety of heuristics. In some contexts, this may also be referred to as a &quot;3rd party&quot; SBOM.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
